# STOLICA is a 170 mm body: its STL (179 MB), geometry dump (35 MB) and raw G-code (66 MB) are
# reproducible from core/weft_field_geometry.mjs. The sliced container and the evidence travel;
# the bulk does not. Rebuild command and SHA-256 are in the specimen README (2026-10-02).
specimens/2026-10-02_stolica_A1/STOLICA.stl
specimens/2026-10-02_stolica_A1/STOLICA_geometry.json
specimens/2026-10-02_stolica_A1/STOLICA.gcode
